Higher Education Act (HEdA)
SR 414.20 — Federal Act of 30 September 2011 on Funding and Coordination of the Swiss Higher Education Sector (Higher Education Act, HEdA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2014/691]
